Author: Goga
CreatedAt: 26/08/26
Description: |
  The dynamic plugin-loading mechanism (`LazyLoader`, `LoaderContext`/`NamedLoaderContext`, and
  the per-category factory routines in salt/loader/__init__.py). This is the repository's real
  architectural spine: every plugin-category cell in this forest (`salt/modules`, `salt/states`,
  `salt/runners`, `salt/returners`, salt/cache, `salt/grains`) is a directory of files this
  mechanism discovers and loads, and the root `salt` cell's `Minion`/`Master` classes are the
  composition root that calls these factory routines at daemon startup.
